=== {{PLUGIN_NAME}} ===
Requires at least: 5.2
Requires PHP: 7.4
Stable tag: {{PLUGIN_VERSION}}
License: GPLv2 or later

Lightweight contact blocks for your site.

== Description ==

Adds the [{{PREFIX}}contacts] shortcode and a widget that display
your site's contact details and keep them up to date automatically.

== Usage ==

Place [{{PREFIX}}contacts] in any post or page, or add the
"{{PLUGIN_NAME}}" widget to a sidebar.

Shortcode options:

* [{{PREFIX}}contacts type="phones"] — phone numbers only
* [{{PREFIX}}contacts type="messengers"] — messengers only
